{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "PRO",
  "chapter": 11,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.11.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A false balance ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " abomination to the LORD: but a just weight ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " his delight.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.11.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " pride cometh, then cometh shame: but with the lowly ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " wisdom.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.11.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The integrity of the upright shall guide them: but the perverseness of transgressors shall destroy them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.11.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Riches profit not in the day of wrath: but righteousness delivereth from death.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.11.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The righteousness of the perfect shall direct his way: but the wicked shall fall by his own wickedness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.11.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The righteousness of the upright shall deliver them: but transgressors shall be taken in ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "their own",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " naughtiness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.11.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When a wicked man dieth, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "his",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " expectation shall perish: and the hope of unjust ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "men",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " perisheth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.11.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The righteous is delivered out of trouble, and the wicked cometh in his stead.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.11.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A hypocrite with ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "his",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " mouth destroyeth his neighbor: but through knowledge shall the just be delivered.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.11.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When the righteous prosper, the city rejoiceth: and when the wicked perish, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "there is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " shouting.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.11.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "By the blessing of the upright the city is exalted: but it is overthrown by the mouth of the wicked.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.11.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that is void of wisdom despiseth his neighbor: but a man of understanding holdeth his peace.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.11.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A tale-bearer revealeth secrets: but he that is of a faithful spirit concealeth the matter.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.11.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Where no counsel ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", the people fall: but in the multitude of counselors ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "there is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " safety.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.11.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that is surety for a stranger shall smart ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "for it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ": and he that hateth suretiship is sure.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.11.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A gracious woman retaineth honor: and strong ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "men",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " retain riches.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.11.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The merciful man doeth good to his own soul: but ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "he that is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " cruel troubleth his own flesh.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.11.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The wicked worketh a deceitful work: but to him that soweth righteousness ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "shall be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a sure reward.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.11.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "As righteousness ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "tendeth",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to life: so he that pursueth evil ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "pursueth it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to his own death.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.11.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They that are of a froward heart ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " abomination to the LORD: but ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "such as are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " upright in ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "their",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " way ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " his delight.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.11.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Though",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " hand ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "join",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in hand, the wicked shall not be unpunished: but the seed of the righteous shall be delivered.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.11.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "As",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a jewel of gold in a swine's snout, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "so is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a fair woman who is without discretion.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.11.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The desire of the righteous ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " only good: ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "but",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the expectation of the wicked ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " wrath.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.11.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "There is that scattereth, and yet increaseth; and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "there is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " that withholdeth more than is meet, but ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it tendeth",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to poverty.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.11.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The liberal soul shall be made fat: and he that watereth shall be watered also himself.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.11.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that withholdeth corn, the people shall curse him: but blessing ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "shall be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " upon the head of him that selleth ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.11.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that diligently seeketh good procureth favor: but he that seeketh mischief, it shall come to him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.11.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that trusteth in his riches shall fall: but the righteous shall flourish as a branch.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.11.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that troubleth his own house shall inherit the wind: and the fool ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "shall be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " servant to the wise of heart.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.30",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.11.30",
      "verse": 30,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The fruit of the righteous ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a tree of life; and he that winneth souls ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " wise.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.11.31",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.11.31",
      "verse": 31,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Behold, the righteous shall be recompensed upon the earth: much more the wicked and the sinner.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
